  "description": "An example design for a small-business phone agent: calls arrive over SIP at OpenAI's Realtime API, a speech-to-speech model, and the OpenAI Agents SDK attaches a realtime agent to each call. It books through calendar and CRM tools, asks a person before sensitive actions, uses a smaller text model for SMS confirmations and call summaries, and keeps transcripts and evals for every call.",
